            "review_title": "Review at The Phoenix Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Phan N\n16 contributions\n0\nTop restaurant in Airport.\nJan 2020 • Couples\nI have to say this restaurant so far the best restaurant you can find in the airport. We eat Pho and Noodle here and the taste is superior compared with other restaurants (in the airport).\nPrice is a bit pricy (about $6/person) but it was worth it.\nOne bad thing is I order \"cow tail\" Pho but the one I get is just a standard Pho and it look nothing like the photo in menu.\nRead more\nWritten January 27, 2020",
