            "review_title": "Review at The Phoenix Restaurant",
            "review_text": "đào t\n3 contributions\n0\nBest food I've ever eaten at TSN airport\nMar 2018 • Solo\nI was very tired and hungry after a long flight so I decided to randomly choose a restaurant. I had a bowl of Pho (with beef inside) in The Phoenix Restaurant. At that time, I knew I made the right decision because Pho was so delicious. I will definitely come back if I have the chance\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 23, 2018\nThe One\nHi Mr/Ms,\nThank you for visiting The Phoenix Restaurant. Pho is one of our traditional dish.Besides that there are variety of other foods as well. Next time, please take sometime and try it out. Have a wonderful trip.\nRead more\nWritten March 25, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
