            "review_text": "KaroliinaK74\nSouthern Finland, Finland69 contributions\n0\nAwful food\nMar 2018 • Family\nI ate some vegetable dish with rice, and even though I am not the most picky one, I could not eat the food. The food tasted mostly to nothing (or maybe sodium glutamate) and the vegetables were grey, soft, sad and dead. The rice tasted like processed chemical something. I usually get good food in Vietnam but this was plain awful. I tasted the chicken dish of my friend, and that was maybe 1 point better than mine. She was ok with her food.\nRead more\nWritten March 20, 2018\nThe One\nThank you very much for your comment at our The Phoenix restaurant in Tan Son Nhat International Airport. We would like to receive your comment and try to improve quality of our service in order to serve passengers better in the future. Your comment will be a valuable motivation to make us striving for perfect services.\nWe always hope to welcome you in next times.\nMany thanks & Best Regards,\nRead more\nWritten March 22, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
